item.description:
From polling to&nbsp;local Facebook groups, you can clearly see how concerned many Americans are about artificial intelligence data centers in both. But lately, law enforcement has been forced to investigate perceived calls for violence against local officials related to these projects. We examine the fine line between free speech and calls for violence.

Note: This episode contains strong language.&nbsp;

---&nbsp;

Guest: Curt Devine, CNN Investigates Senior Producer&nbsp;

Host: David Rind&nbsp;

Producer: Paola Ortiz&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin&nbsp;
